{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S11、S12等较短段落里，叙事行与感受词仍然偏密，扫读压力高于X清楚的左右分栏。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词建立了明确的阅读抓手，又把感受按音乐进程逐步呈现，观众更容易边听边理解人物心理如何变化，而不是面对一堆并列情绪标签自行拼接。尤其是反复出现的「自己人」把怀念、孤独、犹豫和最终的自我选择串成了同一条线，前后因果也更清楚。X的两栏结构在短时间内更容易扫读，但右栏不少感受彼此缺少发展关系，Y在音乐同步、心理层次和整体叙事上的收益更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d7181c76-d65e-4f47-b051-18507d42733c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T205918565018Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:01:07.245179+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "303ba77ca68aae9bdd2a1461f41a147bd10414a5f0e8ad2c080ab01d63e12cb8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen